			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-421235">
									

<p>Perhaps the use of chlorine-36 instead of the more common carbon-14 would be a better scientific dating method in this case. Chlorine-36 was produced in nuclear testing and therefore we know when a majority of it was dumped into the environment.</p>
